OpenRBLX is an open-source recreation of the Roblox engine.

Features:
- rbxmx parsing.
- rbxlx parsing.
- parsing models from the 2005 era with original colour and form.
- parsing modern models as well.
- binary formats (rbxm, rbxl) parsing

TODO:
